  stringArray:
  - "An artefact worth $3 billion has been placed inside the Grand Museum \u2014
    but it has been split into three fragments and hidden in three different rooms. "
  - Your job is to retrieve all three artefact fragments before the time runs out.
    But beware, each room has a security guard patrolling the area.
  - Enter the room. Get the artefact. Escape before the timer reaches zero.  Collect
    all three fragments and combine them to obtain the artefact.
  - ' '
